=== record_patterns_bind_fields-1 eval
--- source
match i
               | EmailPass { email, hash: _ } -> email
               | Google { gid }               -> gid
               | Apple { sub }                -> sub
--- params
i|Identity|EmailPass { id: identities.key(uuid("00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000001")), user: users.key(1), email: "ann@example.com", hash: 0x6831 }
--- shape
scalar
--- type
Text
--- expected
"ann@example.com"
